WEBVTT

00:04:27.826 --> 00:04:31.911
seeking advice and spiritual counsel, and through us,

00:04:31.911 --> 00:04:34.451
my father was able to speak

00:04:34.451 --> 00:04:36.645
and uplift,

00:04:36.645 --> 00:04:38.636
letter by letter,

00:04:38.636 --> 00:04:41.100
blink by blink.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:44.992
Everything in our world became slow and tender

00:04:44.992 --> 00:04:48.356
as the din, drama and death of the hospital ward

00:04:48.356 --> 00:04:51.860
faded into the background.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.960
I want to read to you one of the first things

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:58.201
that we transcribed in the week following the stroke.

00:04:58.201 --> 00:05:00.581
He composed a letter,